<h1>Altair Showcase</h1>

<p><code>examples/showcase</code> is the full-stack Altair demo — Record,
sessions &amp; CSRF, multipart uploads, <code>.env</code> configuration,
security headers, JSON + JWT and streaming, all behind the routing DSL.
Browse the feed, sign up, submit a post with an image, publish it, and
read it back as JSON (append <code>.json</code>) or over a stream.</p>

<p>
  <%= link_to "Browse all posts", posts_path %> ·
  <%= link_to "Submit a post", new_post_path %> ·
  <%= link_to "Live stream", stream_path %>
</p>

<h2>Latest posts</h2>
<% if posts.empty? %>
  <p>No posts yet. <%= link_to "Sign up", new_user_path %> and
  <%= link_to "write the first one", new_post_path %> — it reaches the
  feed once you publish it.</p>
<% else %>
  <ul class="feed">
    <% posts.each do |post| %>
      <li>
        <a class="feed-title" href="/posts/<%= post.id %>"><%= post.title %></a>
        <span class="meta">by <%= post.user.try(&.name) %></span>
      </li>
    <% end %>
  </ul>
<% end %>